<title>USA: Enirisorse denies zinc deal with Guemassa.</title>
<headline>Enirisorse denies zinc deal with Guemassa.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enirisorse of Italy said it has not concluded any deals to buy zinc concentrate from Guemassa, the Morroccan-based mine.</p>
<p>&quot;Enirisorse officially denies any deal with Guemassa. This news is completely unfounded because Enirisorse has not yet met Guemassa for 1997 mating season,&quot; said Fabio Rossi, the company's raw materials commercial director, in a statement.</p>
<p>On Friday, European zinc industry sources said Guemassa appeared to have concluded deals to sell zinc concentrates to Enirisorse and another continental smelter.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1640))</p>
